<title>USA: Illinois River grain barge prices - Dec 4.</title>
<headline>Illinois River grain barge prices - Dec 4.</headline>
<text>
<p>Illinois River barge loading terminals bids to producers(dollar/bu)</p>
<p>					South of Peoria  change (cents/bu)</p>
<p>US 2 Yellow Corn		     2.69-2.74		up 1-4</p>
<p>US 1 Yellow Soybeans		 7.03-7.07		dn 1-4</p>
<p>			  Contract bids for January delivery</p>
<p>US 2 Yellow Corn		     2.68-2.72		up 1-2</p>
<p>US 2 Yellow Soybeans		 7.04-7.07		steady to dn 2</p>
<p>US 2 Soft Wheat **		   3.19-3.21		dn 1</p>
<p>				   North of Peoria</p>
<p>US 2 Yellow Corn		     2.71-2.73		up 1-2</p>
<p>US 1 Yellow Soybeans		 7.03-7.06		dn 1-3</p>
<p>			    Contract bids for January delivery</p>
<p>US 2 Yellow Corn		     2.68-2.69		mixed</p>
<p>US 1 Yellow Soybeans		 6.98-7.01		dn 2-3</p>
<p>**June - July Delivery</p>
<p>(Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8720)</p>
</text>
